## Residual risks

- Live identity federation and branch-protection settings are external state and
  require API read-back after bootstrap.
- Scaffold-only modules remain blocked by renderer guards.
- Audit-mode policy does not prevent a violation.
- A single-region configuration cannot meet regional-failure recovery targets.
- Empty contact or approval lists weaken operational response.

## Review triggers

Review this model after identity, backend, connectivity, policy, workflow,
subscription, data-classification, or regulatory changes, and after every
material security incident.

